OL,3,AAbout 700 prisoners to be freed on 1
OL,4,AOctober under revised early release
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,FAbout 700 eligible offenders will leave
OL,8,Fjails in England and Wales on the
OL,9,Fmorning of 1 October and some 2,550
OL,10,Fwill have been released by the end of
OL,11,Fthe year, the government's revised
OL,12,Fearly prison release plan shows.
OL,14,FThe new plan, signed into law and
OL,15,Fpublished online, shows Andy Burnham's
OL,16,Fgovernment kept the promised original
OL,17,Fschedule of how and when offenders will
OL,18,Fleave jail, aside from delaying the
OL,19,Fstart date by a month and excluding
OL,20,Fspecific offences from the programme.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
