OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAbout 700 prisoners to be freed on 1
OL,4,AOctober under revised early release
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,FUnder the original plan, offenders
OL,8,Fserving sentences of up to 19 months
OL,9,Fwould have been eligible from 2
OL,10,FSeptember to walk out of jail after
OL,11,Fserving a third of that time.
OL,13,FIn the Commons on Wednesday, Burnham
OL,14,Fsaid he understood the "anguish" of
OL,15,Fvictims and "listened to what they were
OL,16,Fsaying".
